<title>NETHERLANDS: VNU TAKES STAKE IN RCV ENTERTAINMENT.</title>
<headline>VNU TAKES STAKE IN RCV ENTERTAINMENT.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher VNU said on Thursday it had agreed to take a 50 percent stake in RCV Entertainment, an independent film, video and television distribution company based in Hilversum, Netherlands.</p>
<p>RCV is the largest independent distributor in the Benelux countries, VNU said, with a varied catalogue of around 1,000 American feature films. It is currently distributor for the acclaimed and successful drama &quot;The English Patient.&quot;</p>
<p>No financial details were given, but VNU said the move fit with its strategy of expansion in Europe's fast-growing entertainment market.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
